# Project conventions (rxjs003)

- Import RxJS from CDN ESM: `https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/rxjs@7.8.1/+esm`.
- Study scripts live under `js/js01` … `js/js06`; shared helpers under `libs/`.
- Demos: export `runDemo()`, set `window.runDemo` when console access is needed; ES modules are not global by default.
- Enable **one** script at a time in `index.html` (comment the rest).
- Unit tests use `libs/test.js` (`test` / `expect`); run via browser + static server, not bare `node` (HTTPS imports).
- New deep tutorials as PDF go under `docs/tutorials/`.
- Prefer commented educational samples over production bundler setup unless asked.
